  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This is a hack of Capcom&#039;s Mega Man 2 for the NES. The hack isn&#039;t a complete remake of the original game, but all levels have been changed to look different from the original ones. The colors have also been changed, and a new title screen has been made.\r\n\r\nThis hack includes:\r\n[list][li]New levels[/li]\r\n[li]New colour palettes[/li]\r\n[li]A few graphic changes (very few though)[/li]\r\n[li]Various HEX fixes[/li][/list]\r\n\r\n[i]Version 1.1 (incl. some bug fixes) released on 19 August 2009.[/i]\r\n\r\n[i](DurfarC felt the need to inform that Air Man&#039;s level [b]is[/b] possible, there are ladders hidden in the clouds. Evil.)[/i]"
    }
  ],
